From 914f427ed9630ddb3904dafba763e53d9f133fe3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicolas Grekas <nicolas.grekas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 8 May 2026 22:44:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [Yaml] Bound recursion depth in the parser

Track nesting depth in a shared `ParserState` across both block-level
(`Parser::parseBlock()`) and inline (`Inline::parseSequence()` /
`Inline::parseMapping()`) parsing, with a default limit of 128.

Crafted YAML documents with arbitrarily nested mappings or sequences
otherwise exhaust the PHP stack and crash the worker.
